        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <span class="stat-lbl">Minutes</span>
          <span class="stat-val" id="r-minutes">44,640</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <span class="stat-lbl">Seconds</span>
          <span class="stat-val" id="r-seconds">2.68M</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <span class="stat-lbl">Weekdays (~)</span>
          <span class="stat-val" id="r-weekdays">23</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="calc-right">
    <div class="content-card">
      <h2>Hours Per Month — Every Month of the Year</h2>
      <div class="tip-box">
        <span class="tip-icon">🕐</span>
        <p><strong>Average:</strong> 730.5 hours/month (non-leap year) or 731.0 hours/month (leap year). Work standard: 173.33 hours/month (2,080 hours ÷ 12).</p>
      </div>
