        <table class="conv-table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Month</th><th>Days</th><th>Total Hours</th><th>Work Hours (8h/day)</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>January</strong></td><td>31</td><td><strong>744 hrs</strong></td><td>~184 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr><td>February (regular)</td><td>28</td><td>672 hrs</td><td>~160 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr><td>February (leap)</td><td>29</td><td>696 hrs</td><td>~168 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>March</strong></td><td>31</td><td><strong>744 hrs</strong></td><td>~184 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr><td>April</td><td>30</td><td>720 hrs</td><td>~176 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>May</strong></td><td>31</td><td><strong>744 hrs</strong></td><td>~184 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr><td>June</td><td>30</td><td>720 hrs</td><td>~176 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>July</strong></td><td>31</td><td><strong>744 hrs</strong></td><td>~184 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>August</strong></td><td>31</td><td><strong>744 hrs</strong></td><td>~184 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr><td>September</td><td>30</td><td>720 hrs</td><td>~176 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>October</strong></td><td>31</td><td><strong>744 hrs</strong></td><td>~184 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr><td>November</td><td>30</td><td>720 hrs</td><td>~176 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>December</strong></td><td>31</td><td><strong>744 hrs</strong></td><td>~184 hrs</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
      <h2>Hours in a Year — Full Reference</h2>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto">
        <table class="conv-table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Period</th><th>Total Hours</th><th>Work Hours (40h/wk)</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>1 day</td><td>24 hrs</td><td>8 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr><td>1 week</td><td>168 hrs</td><td>40 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr><td>2 weeks</td><td>336 hrs</td><td>80 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>1 month (avg)</strong></td><td><strong>730.5 hrs</strong></td><td><strong>173.3 hrs</strong></td></tr>
            <tr><td>1 month (28 days)</td><td>672 hrs</td><td>~160 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr><td>1 month (30 days)</td><td>720 hrs</td><td>~176 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr><td>1 month (31 days)</td><td>744 hrs</td><td>~184 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr><td>1 quarter (3 months)</td><td>2,191 hrs</td><td>520 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr><td>6 months</td><td>4,383 hrs</td><td>1,040 hrs</td></tr>
            <tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>1 year (365 days)</strong></td><td><strong>8,760 hrs</strong></td><td><strong>2,080 hrs</strong></td></tr>
            <tr><td>1 leap year (366 days)</td><td>8,784 hrs</td><td>2,088 hrs</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How many hours in a month?</h3>
        <p>A standard month averages 730 hours (365 days ÷ 12 × 24). Exactly: 28-day month = 672 hrs, 29-day month = 696 hrs, 30-day month = 720 hrs, 31-day month = 744 hrs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How many work hours in a month?</h3>
        <p>About 160–184 work hours, depending on weekdays. The standard used in HR/payroll is 173.33 hours/month (2,080 hours/year ÷ 12 months).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How many hours are in February?</h3>
        <p>February has 672 hours in a regular year (28 × 24) or 696 hours in a leap year (29 × 24). Leap years: 2024, 2028, 2032.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How many hours are in a 30-day month?</h3>
        <p>720 hours (30 × 24 = 720). Months with 30 days: April, June, September, November.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How many hours are in a 31-day month?</h3>
        <p>744 hours (31 × 24 = 744). Months with 31 days: January, March, May, July, August, October, December.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How many hours are in a year?</h3>
        <p>8,760 hours in a regular year (365 × 24) and 8,784 hours in a leap year (366 × 24). Work hours per year at 40 hrs/week = 2,080 hours.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-card">
      <h2>Related Tools</h2>
      <div class="next-grid">
